<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ECC" style="id">Thuhilna</book>
  <para style="h">Thuhilna</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thuhilna</para>
  <para style="toc2">Thuhilna</para>
  <para style="mt">Thuhilna</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem-a kumpi a sem David’ tapa Siepa’ thugente.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Siepa in, a mawhnapi, a mawhnapi, na zosie a mawhnapi, ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mite in sun nisa nei-ah gim le tawlin na a sep ziehin bang teng lemlaw nei uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khang khat tawpin khang khat tung a, hinanle leitung a ngaingai bang den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ni suohin ni tum a, a suona munah kilekia pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Leitaw lamah hui lang a, leilu lam kimvel hi; a kimvelin hui lang kawikawi a, a lanna ngai ma-ah a lang zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Luite zosie tuipi sungah luongsuh a, hizongle tuipi a dim tuom sih hi; luite a luonna mun ma ah a luongkia zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sil zosie lunggimhuoi a, mi gen zawh ding hi lo hi; mit in a mucim thei lo a, bil in a zah cim thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ang pieng dingte pen a piengsate ma hi a, a kisemkia dingte zong a kisemsate ma ahi hi; sun nisa nei-ah a tha bangma om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“En in, tami a tha hi,’ ci-a gen thei ding na khat beh a om amah? Tamte eihaw masang kum tampi lai-a na omsa ahi ta bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi masate kiphawh kha nawn lo a, ang pieng lai ding mite zong amate nua-a khangkia dingte in a phawh kha nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keima, Siepa in Jerusalem ah Israel kumpipa ka hi lai-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />leitunga sil kibawl vannuoi pilna tawh sui ding le kantel dingin ka ngaisun hi; Pasien in mihingte tungah tua bang po tawh a kitahla dinga nasep ei guot pen a nuom lo nasep khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sun nisa nei-a sil kibawl vannuoi ka na mu hi; tuale en in, tuate zosie a mawhnapi a na hi a, huipi nuadel tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A kawisate kizezang thei lo a, a om lopi kimawh sim thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Pilna sangpi ka nei a, keima’ mai-a Jerusalem vaihawmte zosie sangin ka pilzaw hi; pilna le theina tampi ka sin zo hi,” kei le kei ka kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuale pilna, motna le ngolnate ka thei nadingin ka lungsim ka zang a, ahi vangin tam zong khu huipi nuadel bang lel ma ahina ka theikhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Azieh pen pilna a tam leh buoina tam a, theina a khan leh dana zong khang hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kei le kei ka kiho a, “Tu-in hing pei in, guolnopna kici hing sin vawng; na nop bangin om vawi,” ka kici hi. Ahi vangin tam zong a mawhnapi ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nuina tawh kisai-in, “Tua khu motna ahi hi,” ka ci a, guolnopna tawh kisai-in, “Tua khu banga kimang ahei?” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Leitungah mihing’ hinkhuo tomkal khat sungin bang sem leh a hoi diei ci ka mu thei cieng dong, ka lungsim in pilna tawh ei makai kawmpi ma-in, zu dawnna tawh ka pumpi nopsah nading sui-in motna ka na pom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nasep lienpite ka na sem hi; keima dingin inn tampitah ka lam a, lengga umte ka bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kei mama in umte le khawl munte ka bawl a, tuate sungah singga kung namcin ka suon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khum panin gamlah singkungte tui buoh nadingin tuikhuhte ka bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Numei silate le pasal silate ka na lei a, ka inn sunga pieng silate zong ka nei hi; kei masang Jerusalem khuopi-a na om ngai khatpo sangin tuuhon le bawnghonte ka hauzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngun le kham, kumpipa’ gou le gamkhente’ gou teng zong keima adingin ka na khol hi; lasiem numei le pasalte zong ka nei a, tahsa lungkim nadingin zineu tampitah zong ka la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n kei ka lien a, ka masanga Jerusalem-a teng zosie ka lehzo hi; ka pil ngai-in zong ka pil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka mit’ lunggul popo panin ka kikoicing sih hi; nopsahna lam panin ka lungsim ka kemcing sih hi, azieh pen ka nasepna zosie-ah ka lung nuom a, tuale tam khu ka nasep gimna zosie zieha ka nga ka thaman ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin ka khut tawh ka sepsa na zosie le tua teng ka sepna zieha ka gimnate ka lungngai a, na zosie a mawhnapi le huipi nuadel ma hi veve a, leitungah bangma lemlaw ding a om tuom vawt sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n kihei-in pilna, motna le ngolna cite ka lungngai hi; bangzieh ahei cile kumpipa nua-a kumpi sem mipa in bang sem thei ahei? A kisemsa teng ma a sem thei bep bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin khuomiel sangin khuovah a hoizawh ma bangin motna sangin pilna hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mipilte in a lutang vuah mit a nei vua, ahi vangin mimawte miel lahah lam a pei uhi. Hizongle amate zosie in a kibanga a tuokhah ding uh thu ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima le keima ka kiho a, “Mimawte tuokhah teng ma kei zong a tuohkha ding ka hi hi; tua ahile bang dinga kei hici pil gumsan ka diei?” ka kici hi. Tuale keima le keima ka kiho a, tami zong khu a mawhnapi ma ahi bo hi, ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile mipilte ading hile, mimawte ading hile, sawtveipi a kikhom kiphawna om tuon lo a, mailam hunah sil bangkim a kimangngil ding ahi lel bo hi. Mimawte bangin mipilte bangci si thei uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n kei adingin leitunga sil kibawlte lungkhamna vive ahi ziehin hinna ka muda hi; azieh pen na zosie a mawhnapi hi a, huipi nuadel tawh kibang lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka nua-a ang pieng ding mite tungah ka nuasie valon ding ahi lam ka thei ziehin leitunga ka nasep gimnate zosie ka huot tha a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuale amate a pil ding ule a mot ding uh koi in thei ahei? Hizongle amate pen ka pilna zangin leitunga ka gimlaw sil zosie tungah thu vaihawm hi ding uhi. Tam zong khu a mawhnapi ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaci’n ka kihei a, leitunga ka sep gimna zosie tungtang thu-ah lungkie-in ka cil a tam hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />azieh pen khat veivei leh pilna, theina, le siemna tawh gimpipi-a na a sem mipa in a sem lo midang khat’ nopsah nadingin tuate zosie ama tungah a nuasie valon ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Leitungah mihingte in tha sanin gimpipi-a a nasepna zosie vuah bang lemlaw a nei uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile a hinkhuo nite uh lunggimna tawh kidim a, a nasepte uzong lungbuoina vive ahi hi; zan nangawnin a lungsim uh a tawlnga sih hi. Tam zong khu a mawhnapi ma ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mihingte adingin an ne tui dawnin amau’ sep gimna tunga lungnopna a mu uh vala a hoi bangma om lo hi. Tam zong Pasien khut pana ang pei ahi lam ka mukhie hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile ama tawh loin koi in an ne thei ding a, koi in guolnopna nei thei ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama a lungdamsahte tungah Pasien in pilna, theina, le lungnopna a pie hi; hizongle mawnei pa tungah Pasien a lungdamsahte tunga kipie ding neisa kaikhopna le kholna nasep beh a pie hi. Tam zong a mawhnapi ma ahi bo a, huipi nuadel ma tawh kibang lel hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na vannuoi adingin hun om ciet a, leitunga a pieng thu zosie in hun a nei ciet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Suo hun om a, si hun om hi; suon hun om a, suonsate a bawkhiet hun om hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tha hun om a, damsah hun om hi; phel hun om a, lamkia hun om hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />kaa hun om a, nui hun om hi; da hun om a, laam hun om hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />suongte a kipaimang hun om a, a kikhopkia hun om hi; kikawi hun om a, kihla hun om hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />kisui hun om a, kimansuo hun om hi; kep hun om a, paimang hun om hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />bawkeh hun om a, khui hun om hi; sip hun om a, ham hun om hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ki-it hun om a, kimuda hun om hi; kido hun om a, kilem hun om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nasemte in a gimna uh panin bang lemlaw uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasien in mi zosie tungah a manlapi khop ding uh nasep a guot lam ka mu zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pasien in amau’ hun tawh kituoh dingin na vannuoi a bawl zo hi; tua tham loin ama in a lungsim sung vuah a tawpsa hun le mailam thu theinopna lungsim guon a, hinanle amate in Pasien’ sepsate a kipatna panin a tawp tanpha-in a thei zo sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate adingin a hin sungun lungdam kipah taha a op ding uh vala a hoi bangma dang a op lo lam ka thei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tua banah mi zosie in an ne tui dawnin a nasepna zosie vuah nuom a sah ding uh pen Pasien’ letsong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pasien’ sep popo kip tawntung ding hi, ci ka thei hi, bangma a kibelap thei sih ding a, bangma lahdawh thei zong ahi sih ding hi; mi zosie in ama mai-ah a zatah thei nadinga Pasien in tami a bawl ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua a omte a na omsate ma ahi hi; ang omkia dingte zong a omsate ma ahi hi; tuale Pasien in a piengngaisate a suikia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua tham loin leitungah thutang munah gitlona om a, dihna munah gitlona a op lam zong ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka lungsim sungah, Pasien in midihte le migilote thu khen ding hi, azieh pen ama in sil bangkim le nasep silbawl vannuoi adingin a hun sekhol zo hi, ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mihingte tawh kisai-in ka lungsim sungah, Pasien in ganhing bang lel ahina uh a lahtel nadinga amate a zelah ahi hi, ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile mihingte tuo ding le ganhingte’ tuo ding a kibang ahi hi; khat a si bangin a khat zong a si hi. Amate in a unpi-un husan a kibang nei a, mihing pen ganhing sangin thupizaw tuon lo hi; azieh pen na zosie a mawhnapi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A unpi-in mun khatah a pei uhi; a unpi-in leivui panin piengin a unpi-in leivui ma a zuonkia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihing hlagau tung lamah kato a, ganhing hlagau nei lamah a peisuh lam koi in thei ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaci’n mi zosie in a nasep ciet uh nuomsa-a a op ding uh vala a hoi bangma ka mu sih hi; azieh pen tua khu amau’ tanh ahi hi. Amate nua-ah bang pieng ding ci a en dingin koi in amate peipi ding ahei?
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leitunga kibawlsietna zosie khatvei ka mukia hi. A kibawlsie mite’ hlitui en in, amate a henem ding koima om lo hi! Amate a bawlsie mite in thu nei mama a, a henem ding koima a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuale a sisa mite thu ka ngaisun a, a hinglai mihingte sangin a sisa mite hampha ka sazaw hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ahi vangin tua tegel sangin mihinga a pieng nai lote le leitunga gitlona teng a mu nai lote hoizaw lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin gimpipi-a nasepna zosie le siemna zosie, mite khatlekhat a ki-enna uh pana ang pieng ahi hi, ci thu ka mu hi. Tam zong a mawhnapi ahi a, huipi nuadel ma tawh kibang lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mimawte in a khut a zep vua, amau’ tahsa a netum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gimpi-a nasepna le huipi nuadelna tawh a kinga khutdim ni sangin, lungnopna tawh a kinga khutdim khat hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Leitungah a mawhnapi khat ka mukia hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tapate hile, sanggamte tanute hile a nei lo, a tolten mite ka mu hi; hizongle gimpi-a a nasep uh khawl hun nei loin hauna tawh lungkim hun zong a nei thei ngai sih uhi. “Keima in nopsahna teng taanin koi adinga gimpi-a na ka sep mawh ahei?” ci-in amate a kidong uhi. Tam zong a mawhnapi hi a, a dahuoi nasep khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khat sangin ni hoizaw hi, azieh pen ama gel in a nasep gimna ziehun thaman hoitah a nga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen ama gel a pua uleh, khat in a khat phongto ding hi; ahi vangin ama tanga ompa pen mi hamsie ahi a, ama a pua khah leh a panpi ding midang a nei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi ni lumton leh a khuo uh lum hi; mi khatguoh bangci bangin a khuo lum thei ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi khat in adang khat zo kha phiel nanle, mi ni in mi khat pen zo hamtang ding hi. Zam thum a kihuol khauhuol tat bai pah lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuhilna a sang nuom nawn lo, vuoi le mot a thuo kumpipa sangin mizawng khangno khat manphazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kumpi gam sungah a zawngsa-a suoh hi zongnanle thong sung panin suohta-in kumpi suoh thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Leitunga a vah kawikawi hinna a nei zosie in kumpipa zalaih ding ahi tua khangno pa’ nua a zui uh ka mu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />ama’ puisa tua mi zosiete sim tal loin a tam uhi. Hinanle ama nua-a a khang mite in ama tungah a lungdam tuon sih ding uhi. Tam zong khu a mawhnapi le huipi nuadel ma tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien’ biehinn sungah na pei ciengin na kalsuon kidawm in; mimawte’ biehpiehna sangin thu ngai dinga ama kunga va naina khu a hoizaw ahi hi; azieh pen amate in sil hoi lo bawlna panin bangci kihep ding ci a thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thu ngaisun masa lopi-in mot ham sinlen, Pasien’ mai-a thu gen dingin na lungsim kinawsah sin, azieh pen Pasien vantungah om a, nang leitungah na om hi; tua ahi ziehin na kam tawmsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile lunghimawna a tam ciengin mang kiman a, mimaw pa in thu tampi a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pasien kunga na kiciem ciengin a tangtunsah ding kiheh sin; azieh pen mimawte tungah ama lungpal lo hi. Na kiciemna tangtungsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na kiciemna na tangtunsah lo sangin na kiciem lo hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mawna sungah na kam in kipuisah sinlen, ka khiel kha ta hi, ci-in Pasien’ siempupa kungah gen sin; bang dingin na thugente ziehin Pasien lungthahsahin, na khuta na sepsate hing susie ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mang tam matna le thu tampi genna-ah a mawhna tam pai hi; ahi vangin Pasien zatah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gam sungah mizawngte kibawlsietna le thuman le thutang palsatna na mu leh, tua thu-ah lamdang sa sin; bangzieh ahei cile ulien khat pen ama sanga a lienzaw khat in en a, ama gel tungah a lienzawte omlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hizongle leitanga pieng zosie mikim ading ahi hi; kumpipa zong lo-a piengte tawh kivah ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sum deigawte sum tawh lungkim ngai lo ding hi; hauna deigawte a ngaza tawh lungkim ngai lo ding hi. Tam zong khu a mawhnapi ma ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Neisa a khan ciengin a ne ding mite zong khang pai hi; a neipa in a mit gela a et ci simlo bang phattuomna nga ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nasemte in tawm a ne a, tam a ne zongin a kimut uh nuom lel hi; ahi vangin a valkai-a hauna in mihaute kimusah thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Leitungah a siehuoi na khat ka mu hi: Sum haute in a sietna ding bepun hauna a khol vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tuale tuosietna khat ziehin a neisa teng a suplaw uhi; amate ahile tate’ nu le pate ahi vangun a khut sung vuah bangma a nei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A nute gil sung panin guohtanga ang pei bangun a guohtang ma-un a peikia ding uhi; amate in a gimna uh pana a nga uh nate bangma khat zong a khut vuah tawi-in a peipi thei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tam zong khu a siehuoi na khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua teng banah amate in a hin sungun lunggimin an a ne vua, lung buoina, natna le lunghamna tampi tawh hunte a mang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A hoi ding ka mu thu khat tami ahi hi: Pasien in leitungah bakhat hinkhuo ei pieh sungin mi khat in a sep gimna thaman ne-in dawnin guolnopna a sui ding pen a kilawm ahi hi; azieh pen tam khu eite’ tanh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ma bangin Pasien in hauna le nei le lamte pie-in tuate a zang thei mi zosie in a tanh dingte uh sang a, a nasep gimna sung vuah lungnopna a sui ding uh ahi hi, tam pen Pasien’ letsong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pasien in lungdamin a opsah ziehin amate in a hinkhuo nite uh ngaisutin a nei kha sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leitungah gitlona khat ka mu a, tua khu mite tungah gih mama hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasien in amate tungah a deigaw zosie uh bangma a kitasam lo dingin hauna, nei le lam, le patawinate pie napi, Pasien in tua nate zangsah loin, midang khat in nopsahlaw zawsop hi. Tam khu a mawhnapi ahi a, a siehuoi na khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pasal khat in ta zakhat nei-in kum tampi zong hing thei kha ding hi; hinanle a khan kum bangza tahin a tam ta zongin a hin sungin nopsahnate a nga sih a, ahi sihle a si ciengin limtaha a kivui sih leh, ama sangin a sisa-a a suoh nausen hoizaw lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen ama a mawhna-a suoh hi a, khuomiel sungah lutin khuomiel sungah ama’ min a kiliemang ta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tham loin ama in ni mukha loin bangma zong thei lo hi; hinanle tua pa sangin tawlngahna muzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama kum tulkhat’ a zani-in hing ta nanle a hoi lamin a zang thei sih hi, a unpi-un mun khata pei hi lo uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mihing zosie’ gimpi pen a kam sung ading hi napi, a ankam tuina un pha ta ci ngai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahile mimawte sangin mipilte in bang hamphatna nei uh ahei? Mihingte mai-a gamtat dan ding a thei mizawng pa in bang phattuomna nei ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na khat i deigawna sangin i nei bang tawh lungkimna khu a hoizaw ahi hi. Tam zong a mawhnapi le huipi nuadel ma tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na a omsa poma min kiphuosa vive ahi a, mihingte bang ahei ci le, amate sanga a vanglienzaw mite a niel zawh lam uh zong kithei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thu tam leh a mawhnapi zong tam pai a, tuaci’n mikhat adingin bangci phattuom ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile a mawhnapi ahi nihlim banga a tawn zinzian mihing hinkhuo tomkal khat sungin mihingte adingin bang pen hoi ding ci koi in thei ahei? Azieh pen amate nua ciengin leitungah bang thu pieng ding ci koi in gen thei ahei?
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sathau manpha sangin minphatna hoizaw a, suo ni sangin si ni hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pawibawlna inn-a haw sangin dana inna haw hoizaw hi; azieh pen mi zosie dingin a tawpna hi a, tua khu a hing laite’ lungsimah teng den ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nuina sangin dana hoizaw hi; azieh pen da mel puohna in lungsim kipahna piengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Dana inn ah mipilte’ lungsim om hi; guolnopna inn ah mimawte’ lungsim om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mimawte lasah i ngai sangin mipilte ei phawsietna ngai ding hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile beeltaw nei- a lingkung kihal ging bangin mimawte nuina ging vapuoh hi; tam zong khu a mawhnapi ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawlsietna in mipilte mawsah a, guhgol nehna in mi lungsim susie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na khat a kipatna lam sangin a tawpna lam hoizaw hi; kiphatsahna sangin lungduoina hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na lung thahsah bai sin, azieh pen mimawte’ awp sungah lungthahna a gieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Bang dingin tuhun sangin hunlui hoizaw ahei?” ci sin. Azieh pen tam na thudawh khu pilna pana ang pei ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pilna pen gouluo za-in hoi a, nisa a mute adingin hamphatna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azieh pen pilna tawh kidalna khu sum tawh kidalna bang ahi a, pilna nei a phattuom zawhna pen pilna in ama a neipa hinna pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pasien’ nasepna lungngai in; ama in a kawisahte koi in zangsah thei ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cithei hunin kipah inlen, hahsat hunin kingaituo in; mihing in ama’ nua-a a pieng ding thute a thei zo lo nadingin Pasien in citheina le hahsatna tungsah kawikawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A mawhnapi-a ka hin sungin na vannuoi ka mu zo hi; midihte a dihna utawh a na si vua, migilote, a gitlo gamtatna utawh a khan uh na sau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kidihsah seng sinlen, zong kipilsah seng sin; bang dinga nang le nang kisusie ding na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Gilo seng sinlen kimawsah seng sin; bang dingin na hun a tun masangin si ding na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Adang khat hlasuo tuon loin a khat zong na tuhdet ding hoi hi; azieh pen Pasien zatah mipa ahile a nipi-in lawcing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khuopi khat sunga om vaihawm mi sawm sangin mipilpa a pilna in hatsahzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A tahtahin leitungah a hoi-a a gamta, a maw ngai vawt lo midih khat zong om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi thugen popo thudon paipai sin, tua hi sihle na nasempa ang gausamna na za kha ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />nang mama in na lungsim sungah midangte tamveipi na samsietna na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tam teng zosie pilna tawh ka zelah hi; keima in, “Pil ta vang,” ka ci a, hinanle tua khu kei bat zawh ding ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua pen gamla mama a, zong a thuh, a thuh mama ahi hi; koi in tua khu mu zo ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Keima in pilna le na vannuoi kigawmna thei-in kantelin a sui dingin ka lungsim ka hei a, tua gitlona ka thei sawmna khu motna ahi a, tua motna zong khu ngolna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Keima in sina sanga a siehuoizaw numei khat ka mu a, tua nu pen thang kamsa bang ahi a, ama’ lungsim pen piel le lenthang kisie bang a, ama’ khut gelah siakhau a om hi; Pasien’ lungsim a sukhate tua nu kung panin suohta a, ahi vangin a thangah maw neite a awh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Siepa in, en in, ka sil mu khu tam ahi hi, a kigawmna ka mu nadingin na khat tungah adang khat ka gawm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />ka lungsimin tua khu ka suisui a, hinanle ka mu zo sih hi. Ka kimupi pasal tulkhat lahah khat bang ka mu a, hizongle tuate zosie lahah numei khat beh ka mu zo sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />En in, kei mu tam beh ahi hi, Pasien in mihingte a thutang dingin ei bawl a, ahi vangin amate in gelna tampi a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mipilpa tawh kibang koi ahei? Na khat’ a khietna koi in let thei ahei? Pilna in mite maitaisah a, ama’ melpuoh hoimaw a kikhelsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasien tungah kiciem zo na hi ziehin kumpipa’ thupieh zui in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zau poma sin; ama in a nop bangin na sem ahi ziehin, thu a hoi khol lo ciengin ama kung panin uoikai loin peikhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile kumpipa’ kammal in vangnei a, ama kungah, “Bang bawl na hei?” ci-in koi in ci thei ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama’ thupieh a mang poma in sietna tuohkha lo ding a, mipilte’ lungsim in a hun le a lampi a thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen amate tungah mihingte’ lungkhamna gihtahin a kikhan vangin, na vannuoi in a hun le a lampi nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A tahtahin amate in bang hing pieng ding ci a thei sih vua, tua ziehin bang ang ci pien ding ahei ci amate kungah koi in gen thei ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hui tungah koima in thunei-in tua hui tucip thei lo a, si ni ding tungah zong koima in thu nei thei lo hi; gal kikap sungin a kitawpsah koima a om sih a, gitlona in migilote a hunkhie thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keima in leitunga kibawl zosie ka lungsim sungah ka ngaisun a, mi khat in adang khat’ siet nadingin a thuneina a zahna teng zosie ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin mi gilote si-in a kivui ka mu hi; mun siengtho panin amate sungtumin a pusuoh zel vua, tua bang a gamtatna ziehun khuopi sungah phatna a nga uhi. Tam zong a mawhnapi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gitlo gamtatna tungah mallang taha thukhenna a kibawl lo ziehin mihing lungsim in sietna bawl ding ngen tang a sawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mawneite in za vei dong sietna bawlin a hinkhuo uh sawt nanle, Pasien a giing mite adingin thu zosie nuom ding hi, ci ka thei hi; azieh pen amate in Pasien a giing uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ahi vangin migilote adingin thu nuom lo ding a, a hinkhuote uh nihlim bangin a sausah thei sih ding uhi; azieh pen amate in Pasien a giing sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Leitunga a pieng a mawhnapi khat om a, tua khu mi dihte in migilote’ gamtatna a thuohlaw vua, migilote in mi dihte’ gamtatna a hamphatlaw uhi. Tami zong khu a mawhnapi hi, ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Leitungah mihingte in an ne tui dawnin amau le amau a guolnop ding vala a hoi om lo ahi ziehin a guolnop ding uh pha ka sa mai hi, azieh pen Pasien in leitungah a hin sungun amate a pieh a nasep gimna uh sung panin a nga thei ding uh tam beh a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pilna nga thei nading le leitunga na kisemte theithei nadingin sun le zanin mite bangci kimutmaw va-ia uh ahei ci ka lung gelgel ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />leitunga a pieng Pasien’ nasepna zosie koima in a theizawh lona ka mukhie hi. Amate in tuami suina-in a gimlaw vangun a mu zo sih ding uhi; mipilte in thei a kisah vangun a thei sieng zo sih uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Keima in tamte zosie ka ngaisun a, Pasien’ khut sungah midihte, mipilte, le amau’ septe bangci op ci ka mukhie hi; itna zieh amah, ahi sihle muda zieh ahei ci koima in thei lo hi. Amate tawh a kisikha vannuoi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a mawhnapi ahi hi, azieh pen midihte le migilote, mihoite le mihoi lote, mi siengthote le mi siengtho lote, biehpiehna a neite le biehpiehna a nei lote zosie tungah a kibang laitanna a tung hi. Mihoite tunga a tun bangin mawneite tungah a tung hi; a kiciemte zong a kiciem lo pa tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Leitunga thupieng zosie lahah a siehuoi khat pen tami ahi hi, tua khu mi vannuoi tungah laitanna a kibangin a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin a hinglai zosie tawh a kizom poma in kinepna a nei hi, azieh pen a sisa humpi sangin a hinglai ui khat hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A hinglaite in a si ding uh thei a, ahi vangin a sisate in bangma a thei nawn sih uhi; amate in thaman a nei nawn sih vua, koima in zong amate a phawhkha nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A itna uh, a mudana ule a thangsietna uh mangthai sieng a, amate in leitunga pieng na zosie tungah satanh kici himhim a neikia ngai ta sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pei in, lungdamna tawh na an ne inlen, lungnopna tawh na zu dawn in; bangzieh ahei cile Pasien in na sepnate a sawtvei laipi-a ang na pompiehsa ahi ta bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na puonsilte a kang vive hisah in; na lu zong sathau tawh kita sah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pasien in leitunga ang pieh a mawhnapi ahi na hinkhuo nite, na it mama na zi tawh nuomtahin zang in, azieh pen tam leisiet na hinkhuo-a na sep gimnate ziehin na lemlaw khu tua beh ma ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na khut in sep ding a mu popo na tha neiza tawh sem in; azieh pen Misikhuo ah nasepna, thu ngaisutna, theina, le pilna cite a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leitungah ka mukia thu khat in tai kidemna ah mi malgangte in zo kim lo a, mi thahatte in zong gal zo kim loin, mipilte in an kham kim lo a, miteite hau kim tuon loin, misiemte in zong maipha nga kim tuon lo hi; hizongle hun le ni kiheina dung zui-a amate tunga na pieng ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azieh pen koima in a vangsiet hun ding a genkhol thei sih hi. Nga len tawh a kimante le va thanga a awhte bangin, amate tungah tua bang vangsietnate thakhatin a tun ciengin, mihingte zong a awh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Leitungah tami pilna gentena zong ka mu a, tua khu kei adingin a thupi mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi tawmno khat’ tenna khuoneu khat a om hi. Tua khuo sim dingin a thahat kumpi khat kuonin galkap tampi tawh tua khuo a kui-im hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua khuo sungah a pil mizawng khat om a, tuale ama in a pilna tawh tua khuo hunkhie hi. Hizongle tua mizawngpa koima in a phawhkha sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n keima in, “Thagum hatna sangin pilna hoizaw hi; hizongle tua mizawngpa’ pilna kithusim pieh lo a, ama’ thugente kingai pieh lo hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mimawte lahah uhpa khat’ kikona i ngai sangin oldam taha mipilte’ ham thupisim huoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kidona galhiemte sangin pilna manphazaw a, ahi vangin khielna khat in na hoi tampi susie thei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tho sisate in panamtui bawlpa’ sathau namsiesah hi; tuaci’n motna neuno khat in pilna le patawina susie thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mipilte’ lungsim ziet lamah awn a, mimawte’ lungsim vei lamah awn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lam pei kawm nangawnin mimawte in ngaisutna a nei sih vua, amate in a mot lam uh mi vannuoi tungah a lah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ang uhpa na tunga a lungthah leh, na nasep za nuasie sin, azieh pen sip didena in khielna lienpite a damsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tam leitungah gam uhpa’ pana khielna lienpi ziehin a pieng sietna hoi lo ka mu khat khu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />panmun sangpite-ah mimawte kikoi a, panmun niem-ah mihaute a to uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sakol tungah silate tuong a, sila bangin a keng tawh miliente a pei ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Dumto poma dum sung ma-ah kie ding hi; kul tovang poma gul in tu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Suongto poma suong tawh liem ding hi; singlete poma zong sing ma tawh a liem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hei a bol a, a kitat hiem sih leh thatang san den kul hi; ahi vangin mi khat a lawcin thei nadingin pilna in panpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A kihlim masangin gul in ei tuh leh, a hlimpa adingin kimanna om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mipilte’ thugen in amate maipha ngasah a, ahi vangin mimawte’ ham in amate netum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A kamhamte uh motna tawh a pan vua, a thugen tawpna uh pen mot gitlona tawh a khum uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />hinanle mimawte in thu mot gengen a, a pieng ding thu koima in thei lo hi, mai lama thu pieng ding koi in gen thei ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mimawte’ nasep in amate a gimsah hi, azieh pen amate in khuopi zotna lampi a thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nasem khat kumpi-in nei-in, zingmawnga pawi bawl ulien a nei gam aw, gimna na thuoh ding hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nampite khat kumpi-in nei a, a hun huna pawi a bawl, kham nading ahi lo, hat nadinga zu a ne ulien nei gam aw, mi nuomsa na hi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thasiet ziehin innkhum vang a, thada ziehin inn guo ke hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nui nadinga pawi kibawl ahi hi; zu in hinkhuo nuomsah a, sum in kisapna zosie kicingsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na lungsim nangawnah kumpipa gausam sinlen, na lupna tung nangawnah mihaute gausam sin; azieh pen hui lahah a leng vata khat in na thugen teng puoh thei ding a, hla nei ganhing kimkhat in na thugen teng na gensawn thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuite tungah na anlum pai lacin, ni tampizaw ciengin na ngakia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na neisate lampi sagi ah hile, lampi gietah hile khen kawikawi in, azieh pen leitungah bang sietna pieng ding ci na thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Meiite sungah guotui a dim ciengin leitungah guo-in zusuh hi; sing khat leitaw lam ahi sihle leilu lama a pua leh, a puana munah a luongin tua sing lum den ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hui lan a melci poma in khai a tu sih ding hi; meiilum a en poma in zong an a la sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A nu’ gil sunga gu le tangte lahah husan bang ang ci pien ahei ci na thei lo ma bangin, sil bangkim a siem Pasien’ nasepte na thei zo sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zingmawngin na khaici tu inlen, nitah ciengin na khut mawh opsah sin; bang ding ahei cile ang hoi ding pen tami amah, khumi ahei, ahi sihle a nipi-a ang hoi ding ma ahei, ci thu na thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khuovah hoi mama a, mit in ni a mu ciengin a nuom mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kum tampitah a hingte nangawn in tuate zosie nuomtahin zang ta uheh; hizongle khuomiel nite ang tam ding hi, ci phawh ta uheh. Ang tung zosie a mawhnapi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khangnopa aw, na khangdawn lai-in lungdam inlen, na khangno hun sungin na lungnop bangbangin om in. Na lunglam le na mit in hoi a sahna lam zui in, ahi vangin tamte zosie ziehin Pasien in na tungah thu ang khen ding ahi ci thu thei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na lungsim sung panin patauna tawpsah inlen, na tahsa natna zosie paimang in; azieh pen khangdawnna le hinkhuo kipatcil lam pen a mawhnapi ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lungkham hun ang tun masang, “Hinkhuo nuomsa sing,” na ci ding kum in ang phah masang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />nitang khuovah le hlapi le aasite mielin, guo tawh meiilumte a kilekia masang na khangdawn lai-in nang ang siempa phawh in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />khum hun sungin inncingte citunin, mi thahatte a kawng uh kon a, numei ansute a tawm ziehin a khawl cieng, tawlet-a khuodahte a mit uh a miel cieng;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />gawldung kotpite kikhacipin an gawina ging nawn loin vata ham khat in ang phawn a, nungah lasate’ aw a gin nawn lo cieng;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />mi khat in khosangte giingin gawldung ah patauna ang op cieng; kawlthualu kung ang paa-in khuombaite zong kipuola-in lunggulna ang tawp cieng dong ahi hi; azieh pen mi zosie in a tawntung inn uh a zot kul a, a kap amate in gawldung lam a zuon ta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngun khauhuol kitanin kham kuongkumte keh ding a, tuinah-a tuibelte kitawkehin tuikhuh sunga tuikhaina lengpeite kitan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khum hun ciengin leivui in a kisiemna lei zuonkia-in, husan in ama a pie pa Pasien kung zuonkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A mawhnapi, na vannuoi a mawhnapi ahi hi, ci-in Siepa in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Siepa a pil banah, theina, thu khinkhai theina, sinna le paunahte guoldan zong mite hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siepa in a zahnophuoi kamtengte a mu thei nadingin sui a, ama in thuman siengtahin na giel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mipilte’ thugente cienghiem tawh a kibang a, kammal ahile a kikhawmte pen tuucing khat in a pieh, kiptaha a kikhen siakilte tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka tapa aw, tam teng banah kidawm in. Laibu tampi bawlna in tawp hun a nei sih a, lai tampi simna zong tahsa gimna bep ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thu khupna-ah thu zosie kiza sieng zo hi; Pasien zatah inlen a thupiehte zui in; bang ding ahei cile tua khu mi vannuoi’ sep ding nasep ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Azieh pen a sie hile a pha hile a kiguhsep na zosie nangawn tungah Pasien in thu ang khen ding hi.
  </para>
</usx>
